sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client Service
    participant API as WheelHub API
    participant Store as Repo Store

    Client->>API: GET /api/repos
    API->>Store: Fetch all repositories
    Store-->>API: Repo list []
    API-->>Client: 200 OK · JSON array of repos

    Client->>API: GET /api/repos/{id}
    API->>Store: Fetch repo by ID
    Store-->>API: Repo object
    API-->>Client: 200 OK · JSON repo object

    note over API: 404 returned if repo ID not found